GET {{baseUrl}}/product-batches?branch_id={{branchId}}&product_id={{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ✅ IMPORT STEP 4: Verify inventory increased
GET {{baseUrl}}/branch-inventory?branch_id={{branchId}}&product_id={{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

